  "label": "User projected onto the armed_men as the perpetrators of violence",
  "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the visual entity 'armed_men' as the agents of the violence described in the text. The meme frames the user as someone who must confront or judge the actions of these armed men, who are depicted as violent actors targeting LGBTQ+ individuals and women, and are falsely linked to 'democrats and liberals'. This projection is implicit through the accusatory tone of the text and the visual presentation of the armed men as the focal point of blame.",
